t Name* Email Address* Phone Number Address* Address Line 2 City* State* Zip Code* Country* Deposit Information New Student Deposit Please Select New Student Enrollment Deposit ($200.00) Housing Deposit Please Select Housing Deposit ($100) Housing Deposits are required for students planning to live in on-campus housing. Completing your housing deposit now will increase your priority for housing option Total $ 0.00 Name on Card* Credit Card Number (No Dashes)* Expiration Date* Security Code* Signature* Signature By checking this box and signing this form, I certify that the above information is true and correct to the best of my knowledge.* Signature box not working? I'm having issues with the signature box Go Back Save and Continue Submit 1 Basic Information 2 Deposit Information Give to Eureka College 300 East College Avenue  Eureka, IL 61530-1500 (888) 438-7352 Get In Touch Name Email Address Phone Mailing Address City State Zip Country Type of Student Please Select Prospective Freshman Transfer Re-Enroll Continuing Education Type of Contact Please Select Prospective Student Prospective Parent/Guardian Alumni Donor Friend of College Comments Submit Resources Annual Security Report Student Accounts Campus Map Consumer Information Dickinson Commons Staff Directory EID Statement Employment Marketing Student Handbook Technology Title IX Connect With Us Facebook Instagram Twitter YouTube LinkedIn Google Hours 8:00 a.m. - 5:00 p.m. Monday through Friday Copyright © 2025. Eureka College. All Rights Reserved. | Privacy Policy CYBERNAUTIC WEB DESIGN"
