rofessional School Resources Internships Fellowships & Graduate Scholarships Internship & Job Search Websites Outcomes Faculty & Staff Resources About OSL Meet the Student Life Staff Student Resources Health & Wellness Counseling Services Service Opportunities Student Code of Conduct Campus Climate Response Team Student Clubs and Organizations Student Programs Greek Life First Generation Program Leadership Rising Program Parking On Campus Student Resources Buy Books Sell Books Shop EC Gear International Student Services Overview Employment Maintaining Status International Student Forms Travel Guidelines Back Donate Donate Planned Giving Matching Gifts More Ways to Give Back Back Current Students Financial Aid Student Portal Resources Buy Books Sell Books Shop EC Gear Coronavirus Student Report Form Back Back Alumni Student Success Initiative Events Meet the Advancement Team Alumni Leadership Alumni Awards Class Notes Milestones Recommend Eureka Shop EC Gear Back Love is in the Museum January 2022 February 2022 March 2022 April 2022 May/June 2022 July 2022 October 2022 February 2023 March 2023 April 2023 September 2023 May 2024 June 2024 Fall 2024 Winter 2024 December 2024 February 2025 March 2025 April 2025 May 2025 Summer 2025 September 2025 December 2025 February 2026 May 2026 August 2026 Back Staff/Faculty Resources Human Resources Shop EC Gear Back Back Apply Deposit Visit Donate Calendar Info Faculty Home / Student Life / Career Services / Career Services Overview / Internship & Job Search Websites Internship & Job Search Websites Job, Internship, and Volunteer Postings Eureka College routinely emails job opportunties to students from careerservices@eureka.edu and on the perpetual Career Development Canvas course. All students are registered for that course. Please check your email and Handshake for local job opportunites. For additional opportunities, please use the websites below to search for internships & jobs. Forage Job Simulations also provides internships and jobs for undergraduates and recent graduates. Remember, the easiest way to find a job/internship is to utilize your network contacts. Reach out to people you already know for opportunites. You can use LinkedIn to search for alumni connections. The next step is a simple Google search for opportunities, followed by detailed search using job posting search engines such as Indeed or any of the websites listed below. If an internship experience is cost prohibititive, please reach out to your advisor or David Speiser for information about the Experiential Learning Grant. If you need any additional career search help, please book an appointment with David Speiser, Director of Career Services via Handshake . Internships: Absolute Internship Glassdoor Idealist Indeed Intern queen LinkedIn (Internships) Monster Way Up Zip Recruiter Chicago Area: Chicago Jobs Chicago Artist’s Resource Chicago Environmental Jobs League of Chicago Theaters Creative: Creative Hotlist Entertainment Careers League of Chicago Theaters Chicago Artist’s Resource Design Jobs Upwork Freelance Work for Designers Education: AppliTrack (Frontline) Regional Offices of Education Peoria Public Schools K-12 Job Spot Illinois Education Job Bank (IASA) Higher Ed Jobs Accounting, Finance, & Business: I Hire Accounting Accounting Jobs E Financial Careers Sales Jobs Health: vivian.com psychologyjobs.com All Jobs/General: Short Term Adventure Jobs Careerrookie.com Careeronestop.org Careerbuilder.com CoolWorks - \"Jobs in Great Places\" Google Jobs Idealist.com Indeed.com LinkedIn monster.com ziprecruiter.com Environmental: The Student Conservation Association Chicagoland Environmental Jobs Environmental Jobs Environmental Internships Environment Jobs Government: Go Government USA Jobs Government Loop Career One Stop Illinois Job Link Work 4 Illinois US Department of State International: Internabroad.com Ihipo.com Eslcafe.com Transitionsabroad.com Idealist.org globaljobs.org Sports: careerathletes.com https://www.jobmonkey.com/sports/internships_in_sports/ jobsinsports.com teamworkonline.com ncaamarket.ncaa.org/jobseekers/ workinsports.com/ corporateplaybook.com nacda.com/nacdajobs/nacda-nacdajobs.html teamusa.org/careers Back Give to Eureka College 300 East College Avenue  Eureka, IL 61530-1500 (888) 438-7352 Get In Touch Name Email Address Phone Mailing Address City State Zip Country Type of Student Please Select Prospective Freshman Transfer Re-Enroll Continuing Education Type of Contact Please Select Prospective Student Prospective Parent/Guardian Alumni Donor Friend of College Comments Submit Resources Annual Security Report Student Accounts Campus Map Consumer Information Dickinson Commons Staff Directory EID Statement Employment Marketing Student Handbook Technology Title IX Connect With Us Facebook Instagram Twitter YouTube LinkedIn Google Hours 8:00 a.m. - 5:00 p.m. Monday through Friday Copyright © 2025. Eureka College. All Rights Reserved. | Privacy Policy CYBERNAUTIC WEB DESIGN"
